  // ---- the exported report -------------------------------------------------
  //
  // The PDF and the spreadsheet, written in the language their reader chose.
  // Only the words the file needs and the screen does not: a column heading
  // ("How far") where the screen has room for a sentence ("How far the month
  // has got"), and the few lines that exist only on paper. Everything the two
  // say alike reads the same key, so a report cannot say one thing on screen
  // and another in the file somebody carries to the meeting.
  //
  // These keys are called from server/routes/reports.js, not from the browser.
  // tests/translations.test.mjs scans the API's own t('...') calls for exactly
  // that reason -- without it every key here would read as unused.
